WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.102
This query uses two windows over the same employee rows.

00:00:04.102 --> 00:00:09.827
Average salary with partition by department calculates the department average.

00:00:09.827 --> 00:00:15.447
Row number with partition and order assigns a sequence within each department.

00:00:15.447 --> 00:00:17.752
No group by is used.

00:00:17.752 --> 00:00:22.880
Every employee row remains in the output, with additional context beside it.
